From: Caleb Ethridge <caleb.ethridge@analog.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 15:20:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] arm: dts: sc5xx: Keep USB nodes in SPL DT for USB Falcon boot

Tag the USB controllers (and, on SC59x, the nop-phy and USB pin group)
with bootph-pre-ram so they are retained in the trimmed SPL device tree
and probed by the SPL on all SC5xx boards. Required for the USB
mass-storage Falcon (SPL OS boot) path.

Signed-off-by: Caleb Ethridge <caleb.ethridge@analog.com>
---
diff --git a/arch/arm/dts/sc57x.dtsi b/arch/arm/dts/sc57x.dtsi
index b162e61d85a..aa3f1ec241f 100644
--- a/arch/arm/dts/sc57x.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm/dts/sc57x.dtsi
@@ -136,3 +136,7 @@
 &i2c2 {
 	clocks = <&clk ADSP_SC57X_CLK_CGU0_SCLK0>;
 };
+
+&usb0 {
+	bootph-pre-ram;
+};
diff --git a/arch/arm/dts/sc58x.dtsi b/arch/arm/dts/sc58x.dtsi
index e6542bc5bd1..223a0340002 100644
--- a/arch/arm/dts/sc58x.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm/dts/sc58x.dtsi
@@ -181,3 +181,11 @@
 &i2c2 {
 	clocks = <&clk ADSP_SC58X_CLK_CGU0_SCLK0>;
 };
+
+&usb0 {
+	bootph-pre-ram;
+};
+
+&usb1 {
+	bootph-pre-ram;
+};
diff --git a/arch/arm/dts/sc59x.dtsi b/arch/arm/dts/sc59x.dtsi
index 0fde7d5e204..34adad4ad97 100644
--- a/arch/arm/dts/sc59x.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm/dts/sc59x.dtsi
@@ -206,3 +206,15 @@
 &eth0 {
 	reg = <0x31040000 0x1000>;
 };
+
+&usb0 {
+	bootph-pre-ram;
+};
+
+&usb0_phy {
+	bootph-pre-ram;
+};
+
+&usb0_default {
+	bootph-pre-ram;
+};
-- 
2.34.1
